## 3.1 Design philosophy

Combine four complementary ideas:

### A. Living India
Cinematic cultural imagery and seasonal visual transitions that make the application feel alive.

### B. Cosmic Panchang
Beautiful, restrained astronomical visualizations that make Panchang information easier to understand.

### C. Festival Editorial
A curated, editorial presentation of festival information, with strong typography and intentional visual hierarchy.

### D. Modern Ritual Companion
A practical, focused interface for preparing and following rituals.

